|  +--------+ +--------+ +--------+ +--------+ +--------+         |
|  | O6     | | O7     | | O8     | | O9     | | O10    |         |
|  +--------+ +--------+ +--------+ +--------+ +--------+         |
|  +--------+ +--------+ +--------+ +--------+ +--------+         |
|  | O11    | | O12    | | O13    | | O14    | | O15    |         |
